<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.875.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price of 99.875.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 1.5 trillion yen worth of</p>
<p>three-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Friday:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.875  Stop rate     0.491 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.875  Average yield 0.49 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   6.17731  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.49987  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 31.0035 pct</p>
<p>Issue date	 Aug 20, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity	   Nov 20, 1997</p>
